0+00:00\",\"description\":\"Guy Harris is the voice of ID Mobile sponsor bumper ad on 4 Music. Click on the link to learn more about the voiceover and how you can can work with Guy Harris!\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"4 Music — ID Mobile Sponsor"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A bright, quirky voiceover style for these short bumper ads on 4 Music</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/michelin-cross-climate-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Michelin Cross Climate Explainer","aria-label":"Previous: Michelin Cross Climate Explainer","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/falcon-alkoholfri-attenborough-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"David Attenborough Falcon's Beer","aria-label":"Next: David Attenborough Falcon's Beer","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Voicing short sponsor bumpers for ID Mobile</h2>\r\n<p>Sponsor bumpers are a great way to connect with the viewership or listeners of the best TV shows and radio shows. You've probably seen hundreds of them before and not really realised you were being advertised to. They appear at the start and the end of every ad break and always connect the brand with the show. ID Mobile asked me for a bright, quirky sort of voice and I think I've delivered exactly what they wanted. If you'd like to hear a few more examples of this style, check out my <a href=\"/dead-daises-promo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Dead Daisies Voiceover\">Dead Daisies</a>, and <a href=\"/horlicks-promo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Horlick Voiceover\">Horlicks</a> videos. However, it's also worth noting that I voice all little voices in the background too! </p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6zOVX7VeH2Y","title":"4 Music — ID Mobile Sponsor","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice.jpg","alt":"4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"4 Music — ID Mobile Sponsor"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about ID Mobile</h2>\r\n<p>In case you hadn't heard of them before, ID Mobile is an online retailer that specialises in cheap mobile phones and sim-only deals. I was impressed to see that they sell all the latest phones too; it's not just old phones. I'm always happy to be the voice of smaller, up-and-coming brands, but I'm also especially pleased to have my voice featured on <a href=\"https://www.channel4.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"4 Music\">4 Music</a>. I think these sponsor bumpers look and sound great, so I''m really pleased with how they've turned out!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you need a voiceover professional with a range of voices like the ones featured in ID Mobile's sponsor bumpers on 4 Music, please feel free to <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. Whether you're working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, I've voiced literally hundreds of different things and I'm always happy to hear from anyone who would like to work with me.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"4 Music — ID Mobile Sponsor","pageUrl":"4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","879",{"href":"/ariel-pods-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/ariel-pods-voiceover.jpg","alt":"ariel-pods-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Short How-to Video for Ariel Pods"}]]}],["$","$L3","472",{"href":"/a-team-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/a-team-voice.jpg","alt":"A-Team Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"A-Team Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","695",{"href":"/greedy-granny-tv-commercial","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/greedy-gra